@page "/practice"

<PageTitle>Practice | Python Study Companion</PageTitle>

<section class="page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">TURN KNOWLEDGE INTO CONFIDENCE.</p>
    <h1>Practice</h1>
    <p>Test your knowledge, solve a problem, or look up a pattern.</p>
</section>

<div class="action-grid">
    <a class="action-card" href="practice/quiz" aria-labelledby="quiz-heading">
        <span class="action-symbol" aria-hidden="true">?</span>
        <span class="pill">CHECK YOUR UNDERSTANDING</span>
        <h2 id="quiz-heading">Quick quiz</h2>
        <p>Check your understanding with 5, 10, or 15 multiple-choice questions, explanations, and a review of missed answers.</p>
        <span class="text-link">Start a quiz &rarr;</span>
    </a>
    <a class="action-card" href="practice/coding" aria-labelledby="coding-heading">
        <span class="action-symbol blue" aria-hidden="true">&lt;/&gt;</span>
        <span class="pill">THINK IT THROUGH</span>
        <h2 id="coding-heading">Coding exercises</h2>
        <p>Think through a small Python problem, use a hint, then reveal a solution and learn how it works. No code execution required.</p>
        <span class="text-link">Explore exercises &rarr;</span>
    </a>
    <a class="action-card" href="practice/algorithms" aria-labelledby="algorithms-heading">
        <span class="action-symbol" aria-hidden="true">{ }</span>
        <span class="pill">YOUR PYTHON REFERENCE</span>
        <h2 id="algorithms-heading">Algorithm Library</h2>
        <p>Explore worked Python examples, step-by-step walkthroughs, complexity, and common mistakes.</p>
        <span class="text-link">Browse algorithms &rarr;</span>
    </a>
</div>
